          "type": "singleCorrect",
          "level": 2,
          "question": {
            "text": "$\\mathrm{Al}$ (at. wt 27 ) crystallizes in the cubic system with a cell edge of $4.05 Ã…$. Its density is $2.7 \\mathrm{~g}$ per $\\mathrm{cm}^{3}$. Determine the unit cell type calculate the radius of the $\\mathrm{Al}$ atom",
            "image": null
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "WHd4R",
              "text": "$\\mathrm{fcc}, 2.432 Ã$",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "K21Bv",
              "text": "bcc, $2.432 Ã$",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "K2J0M",
              "text": "bcc, $1.432 Ã$",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4WlEo",
              "text": "$\\mathrm{fcc}, 1.432 Ã$",
              "isCorrect": true,
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "$\\rho=\\frac{Z \\times M}{N_{0} \\times a^{3}}$,\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n2.7=\\frac{Z \\times 27}{6.02 \\times 10^{23} \\times(4.05)^{3} \\times 10^{-24}}\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n$\\therefore Z=4$\r\n\r\nHence it is face centred cubic unit lattice.\r\n\r\nAgain $4 r=a \\sqrt{2}=5.727 Ã…$\r\n\r\n$\\therefore \\mathrm{r}=1.432 Ã…$",
            "image": null
          },
